invariant: INV-35
file: Makefile
catches: test/lib-check-webpki-tcp-nonblocking.sh
reason: The object's header leaves out the transport define of a
  tcp-nonblocking object. A consumer that compiles under the header alone
  then declares the tcp-blocking layout and names the tcp-blocking build
  record, which this object does not define, so lib-check's consumer
  under the header fails to link (docs/decisions.md 133).

--- old
	  for d in $(patsubst -D%,%,$(LIB_DEF)); do \
--- new
	  for d in $(patsubst -D%,%,$(filter-out -DCH_TRANSPORT_TCP_NONBLOCKING,$(LIB_DEF))); do \
